*   **Vibration Sensor (Piezoelectric Element):** The piezoelectric element generates a voltage when subjected to mechanical stress (vibration). This signal is typically weak and requires amplification. An operational amplifier (op-amp) salvaged from an old audio device can be used for amplification.
