    *   **Piezoelectric Element:** Connect the piezoelectric element to the input of an op-amp configured as a non-inverting amplifier. Connect the output of the op-amp to another Arduino analog input pin (e.g., A1).
    *   **Relay:** Connect the relay control pin to a digital output pin on the Arduino (e.g., D13).



